  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "a2c9e90f-1355-46d1-ac43-1f65c7e1eec8",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "405c85f2-fb0f-8422-9787-3c7e3e63e78a",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCIME organised a Shoulder Dystocia - Team\nTraining Workshop in collaboration with SAMI Pharmaceuticals. The purpose of\nthis workshop was to help participants to gain confidence in their skills and\nthe maneuvers to deal with obstetric complications such as Shoulder Dystocia,\nbefore the condition progresses to emergencies.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "\nThis workshop also focused upon the improvement of teamwork, as training in a\nsimulated delivery room by role playing is an efficient method for training\nshoulder dystocia management skill. The main aspects regarding teamwork that\nwere focused were proper and effective communication and the importance of\nbeing ready with a high level of awareness and training to handle vaginal\ndeliveries complicated by Shoulder Dystocia.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "\nOver the period of the workshop, the participants evolved a greater\nunderstanding of how to respond to obstetric complications and emergencies such\nas shoulder dystocia which in turn will result in a better care provided to the\ncommunity. Furthermore, the participants observed and stated effective\nadaptation methods to meet emergency situations.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
